      "review_description": "Sales team were fantastic and were first and only to attend onsite to provide an accurate quote. Communications and service have been ok but have been quiet recently - I still have a query waiting to be answered and still also waiting for assistance in completing the smart meter form which I was told their parts would be complete 2 days ago. The installation was ok with several setbacks including issues with the scissor lift not working half a day to not having the correct covers to complete the inverter installation that day. I made note of the team leaving the first day early and leaving the job site messy. The electrician that remained onsite was tasked to clean up the whole job site on his own and left a few screws lying in the garage which punctured one of my car's tires. Overall somewhat mixed review and not sure whether i'de recommend them.",
