      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I selected Polygon Energy because they provided the best advice and made several site inspections to work through my    questions. One of my preferred components became unavailable and one of the Directors went the extra mile and was able to find the system I wanted; without me having to specifically request it. My very positive pre sales experience led me to purchase my solar system from Polygon Energy.The installation team was very professional and worked all day to finalise the job. Not only were they punctual and polite they kept me informed throughout the day and cleaned up very thoroughly. When the installation was complete they showed me the isolation process and how to use the monitoring application. In the days after the install they were monitoring my system and identified a problem and arranged a time to come back and adjust the system. I was impressed.Their customer service has been fantastic from the initial contact to after installation service. I highly recommend Polygon Energy and I would use them again. Thank you!",
